<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northwest Airlines.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northwest Airlines.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Northwest Airlines Corp to buy from outperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 39-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
